sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GUI
    participant System
    participant Database

    User ->> GUI: Select Date for Logs
    GUI ->> System: Request Logs for Selected Date
    System ->> Database: Fetch Logs from Database
    Database -->> System: Return Logs
    System -->> GUI: Display Logs for User

    loop User Edits Logs
        User ->> GUI: Modify Log Entry (Add/Edit/Delete)
        GUI ->> GUI: Store Change in Action Stack (Undo/Redo)
    end

    alt User Selects Another Date Before Saving
        User ->> GUI: Select Another Date
        GUI ->> System: Request Logs for New Date
        System ->> Database: Fetch New Date Logs
        Database -->> System: Return Logs
        System -->> GUI: Display New Date Logs

        loop More Edits
            User ->> GUI: Modify Log Entry
            GUI ->> GUI: Store Change in Action Stack (Undo/Redo)
        end
    end

    User ->> GUI: Clicks "Save Changes"
    GUI ->> System: Send All Modified Logs to Database
    System ->> Database: Update Only Changed Logs
    Database -->> System: Save Success
    System -->> GUI: Confirm Save to User

    alt User Closes Session
        GUI ->> GUI: Clear Action Stack (Undo/Redo Disabled)
    end
